sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Host log file
    participant C as Collector process
    participant I as Ingestion process
    participant D as Database process
    participant Q as Query handler
    participant M as Maya browser
    C->>F: Read records after checkpoint
    F-->>C: Records with stable event IDs
    C->>I: Publish batch; retain source records
    I->>D: Insert batch; ignore repeated IDs
    D-->>I: Durable commit complete
    I-->>C: Acknowledge batch
    C->>C: Save position in local checkpoint file
    M->>Q: Service and bounded time-range query
    Q->>D: Read committed rows using index
    D-->>Q: Matching rows
    Q-->>M: Bounded results and collector health
